<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="h">Galatiame</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Galatiame dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiame</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal.</para>
  <para style="mt">Galatians</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Galatiame dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul AD 48 kenzwadau laisiu aide raupwa Romme deu Galatia ga Khristianme ngqwadung dage kaigai. Ngqwa aidungde de kemret keledeume Judaizer de kelame ne tei kebwak, penui Gentile Khristianmedung de Jewme zaidung-hegeukerum, ketyeipok keyibe ketyei, nah Jewme hengyi tingbadung kemnei aidungde pelane mzailu mecai penuide kelilu melie di. Hemaa aide Paul au Tinggwang kengkieng gahlie rangdi nah cine, pecu kingnei kerabe melie di.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul Galatiamedung dage pa zierang tei eh ledeu kelade daipai samliakeyibe bi kecu ranggai nah pa kengkieng ngau kelude au Tinggwang dade lie kecu ranggai. Paul rangsi gai, anuide hezai kemzai gade anui mau gade kelilu gailak; anui Jisu Khrista de kenlum rünne gade kelilu bui. Keku gade kenlum keulia maisia nah kenlumme Rabe gade lungh maisia lie kecu Paul ranggai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Mraisam (1:1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang dade Paul kengkieng ngaukelu (1:11-2:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hezai nah Tinggwang ngaugia (3:1-4:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Samliakeyi tei kemzai (5:1-6:16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kekambe (6:17-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Sam keraibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Paul, langkegaibe—mina dade mede mina kilamde de ma, dede Jisu Khrista gade nah Peibe Tinggwang, pecu ketsai gade kwakcuh kelube <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />nah acu ngngwa kela siname pelane ne, Galatia ga ngqwadung dage kekai:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Galatia ga ngqwadung dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Peibe Tinggwang nah anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista dade kegwang ngaugia nah lungciep de peu nnuida bam lulo, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />anuide cu peting kesia aide gade lungmpet beu kerane, anui Tinggwang nah Peibe lungning mzai eh Khrista anui maudung ziemne pe teilung kaibeu, <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Tinggwang depeu kelungta nah kelungta ndu kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samliakeyi keda gah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Khrista ngaugia gade nnuide qu kelube dade nzet süt eh nreupwa samlia kedabe ga gwang dizeu kecune Ih a swagah lie, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />samliakeyi keda gede gah, dede cika midungge ne nnuide kebwak nah Khrista samliakeyi de tei nreudi neula. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Dede anui liede mede tinggim gade tinggimgwame ge samliakeyi anui nnui dage ledeu beu kemakbe nnuide rang ledeu cai, peu pecu reset pung lulo. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Anui pedwa kerangde nzwa, cu Ih rang daila, “Keheibe de nnui dage samliakeyi nnui luu kelude kemak samlia kedage rang ledeu lacai, peu pecu reset pung lulo.”<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Paul de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Kedanemene Ih cu mina suibe mi Tinggwang suibe teineu lano? Mede Ih mina suibe tei kera peei lani? Ih cude mina suibe tei neula liecai, Ih au Khrista kilame tei daulak. <verse eid="GAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Kedanemene sinamedung, Ih samliakeyi rang keliade au mina samliakeyi melie kecu Ih peu nnuide ci neula. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Kedanemene Ih cide mina dade ngau luma, mede cide mide acu ledeu beuma, cide au Jisu Khrista ne keulia kegaige lie. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Kedanemene nnui Ih pedwa Judahme zai ga a teilung lungh kegwang ha ci luda, Ih dainzwa Tinggwang ngqwa de teikeherei süt eh cide tei ngkapdi kera teigwang bi kecu. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ih a leuhme kak gade, a hia a heumedung swade Judahme renet ga mting kieeki, a paume zaisiedung ziemne mtingsüt gai. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Dede a pui za gade acu kedet ntsam kelube, nah pe ngaugia gade acu qu kelube, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />acu pe Napei de pwalia kera pe suidi, ciciu eh Gentileme kakgade acu peu pe zierang teilu kerane, Ih zette mina suibe keteu ma, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />mede Ih Jerusalem ga a dwa langkegaime keraimedung da hang ma. Meliene, Ih Arabia deudi ga mie nah pecai Damascus namdi ga cailigwanglu. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Mmi kecum caine Ih Jerusalem ga Cephas de ci hemi kerane hang nah Ih pecu tingbazie ziangrei eh mengei ge ngngwa bam. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Dede Ih Rampaube sinabe James de gwale langkegaime kedamedung de ngau ma. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Dede Ih nnui dage rau kegaidung de, ainie Ih Tinggwang dwade rangla, Ih au nret ma. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Pecai Ih Syria nah Cilicia cuikuidung ga miedi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Judea ga Khrista da kebam ngqwadung de acu cisiakte mereu. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Dede penui kedame kerang rünne ci, “Piage anuide teikeherei kelabede, pa piage ngkapdi zielie kela kenlum de teu zierang teila dida.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Tinggwang acu ngngwa heta tei kegaide ziemne penui Tinggwang de twadi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Paul de langkegaimedung ne luukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Pecai mmi kereiehmdai cai Ih Barnabas de ngngwa lwe Jerusalem ga hangdai, Titus de acu ngngwa la. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Cu keulia kegaide ziemne Ih cika mie, nah Ih Gentileme kakga samliakeyi paulia kelade penui dage ranglia, dede muiteume dage ngkim eh ranggai, maige Ih a ta tei kelade kemta teidi zielu. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Dede acu nzang kelabe Titus de Greekme ge liede, pe kemei tei eh pegeu rum ma. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Dede mina kangge kenlumme rehi teilwe anui kakga ngkim gwang bam. Penui anui Khrista Jisu de ngngwa kencüt gade ngaukelu suirangketei de pie kerane ngkim gwang bam iciu eh penui anuide hebaangme teilu kerane, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />anui peting kecam nage ziemne de penui kangga nlüt dima, iciu eh samliakeyi kesangbe nnui ziemne kaizeu kerane. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Dede muiteume lie kelamedung (penui keheige teila liede cide a ziemne au magede ma, Tinggwang hegwazu luuma melu)—kedanemene muiteume lie kelamedung de a ziemne au mage dema.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:5">2 Cor. 11:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Hez. 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Meliene, Peter de hegeurum kelume dage samliakeyi de ledeu kera nlum kebeu nzwa acu hegeurum kemakme dage samliakeyi de ledeu kera nlumpwa kepeude penui ci luda. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Kedanemene Tinggwang, Peter de teu hegeu kerumme dage langkegaime ge tei eh peta keteibe, acude teu peta tei eh Gentileme dage langgai. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />James, Cephas nah John, penuide hangkia kentipmebau lie bam kelame, acu pwa kepeu ngaugia de penui ci keludau, penui Barnabas anaide ngngwa kebazwa kelu gade ngngwa bateu, iciu eh anai Gentileme da mie, nah penui hegeukerumme da mie kerane. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Penui kekie au anuide peu kegahme de ngha kera nsung gailo kecude da, Ih de aide teineu lala.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Peter de kerenia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Dede Cephas Antioch namdi ga gwang keludau, Ih pe dwagade pecu mmau kedanemene pa mau kecune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:14">Gal. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Kedanemene James dade mina kangge kegwang dwa, Cephas au Gentileme de ngngwa matyei bam. Dede mina aidungde gwang luge, hegeurum kerabe lie kelamedung de hing eh pa Gentileme dade mpet ntsamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:28">Bat. 10:28</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 11:2-3">11:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Hezaiketei aide ga Jewme kenlumme kedame de pecai suidi, iciu eh Barnabas dede penui hezai ketei dene kemeu teudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Dede penui samliakeyi kesangbe nzui mene penui zaira teikedi Ih ngau luge, Ih Cephas de penui pelane dwagade ranggai, “Nang Jewme ge liede Jewme nzwa mene Gentileme ge nzwa lungh la liecai, dainzwa eh nang Gentileme de Jewme nzwa lungh lulo lulai no?” <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Anui au mnakelu gade Jewme ge nah Gentileme kemaume ma; <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />ciciude hezaibe gade migede de tei masang lula kemak ci eh dede Jisu Khrista de nlumkelu gade kecu ci eh anuide Khrista Jisu de nlum lula, iciu eh hezaibe ta gade mene Khrista de kenlum gade anuide tei masanglu kerane. Kedanemene hezaibe ne pumteihbe gede tei masang gailak lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20-22">Rom. 3:20-22</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 3:9">Php. 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Dede Khrista gade anui masanglu kera peei keladau, anui katei anuide kemaume lie kecu ngaulu lacai, ciciu cai Khrista kemau gwa tei lani? Aiciu mezing! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Kedanemene Ih hezai kehegwa teimsia kedidung de Ih retakdai lacai, Ih hezai gikah kedime lie acu keulia la dida. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kedanemene Ih hezaibe gade hezaibe gage tsaigai dida, iciu eh Ih Tinggwang dage ring gailu kerane. Acu Khrista de ngngwa gwak dida, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />nah ring kelade au Ih ma, dede Khrista a lungga ringla. Nah Ih cu pumteih gade ring kelade, Ih Tinggwang Nabe de kenlum gade ringla, pa acu kula nah a ziemne pe teilung kaibeu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Ih Tinggwang ngaugia de keu hezia dima, kedanemene hezaibe gade mide tei masang lula liecai, Khrista tsit au kemta da!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Kenlum mede hezai kemzai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Kemie Galatiamedung! Caune nnuide kemeudi deno? Nnui miak dwaga Jisu Khrista de gwakkedi ha mcigi bam. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ma aide rünne Ih nnui dade ci neula: Nnui hezai bata gade Kemci Rabe ngaulu dimi, siu kelude nlumkelu gade no?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:5">Gal. 3:5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:8-10">Bat. 15:8-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Nnui miesüt di deni? Rabe gade teilung keheci ndeu kelucai, daitei cu pumteihbe gade nnui yicangsiaklu kera peei lano? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Nnui reisüt kegaide magede meni—cide magede kemak kesang de cai? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Cine, Rabe nnuide pwa kepeube nah nnui kakga miswakegah batadung keteibe de hezaibe kemzai gade cidungde tei ni, mi samliakeyi de siulwe nlumkelu gade no? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Cinzwa eh Abraham, “Tinggwang de nlumlu nah cine pecu masang lie luulu,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ken. 15:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />cine kenlummedung Abraham leuhmedung lie kecu ci lulo. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Nah kesanglaisiu, Tinggwang Gentileme de kenlum gade tei masanglu kera mrai ngau eh samliakeyi de mrai ledeu pwa Abraham dage ranggai, “N dade heleuh pelane de samlam beuzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Ken. 12:3</ref>;<ref loc="GEN 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Cine nlumkelume de au Abraham nlumkelube de ngngwa samlam beu dida. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Hezaibe bata ga ngngei kelame pelane reset kangga la dida; kedanemene ainzwa raupwa la, “Hezai laisiukwak gage rauteu keladungde pelane mzai nah teila kemakme pelane de peu reset punglu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Hez. 27:26</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 2:20">Jas. 2:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Cu migede Tinggwang dwagade hezaibe ne tei masang lula kemak ci mci luda, kedanemene, “Masang kelame kenlum gade ring luzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab. 2:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Cu hezaibe au kenlum gade ma, dede, “Hezaibe tei kelabe cidungde gade ring luzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev. 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Anui ziemne reset ge tei eh Khrista anuide hezaibe reset gade rilu da, kedanemene kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa raupwa kela, “Tsingbang reu gage gwak kedi leune reset pung dida”—<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Hez. 21:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />iciu eh Khrista Jisu gade Abraham samlam de Gentileme da gwanglu kerane, nah anui kenlum gade sampet kebeu Rabe de ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezaibe nah sampet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Sinamedung, mina zai ria gade Ih rang gaila. Mina ne teikelu samkak de migede gileu mede cikage kaisi lula ma, piage hezaibe gade cide tei dicai. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Sampet de Abraham nah pe leuhbe dage ranggai beu. Pa cide, “heleuhme dage,” de rang ma, pekie mina kekiee ge dage, dede, “n leuhbe dage,” pekie hangge dage, cide au Khrista.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:1">Mat. 1:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Ih rang kerabe kie au aide: Hezaibe, mmi haimdai eh camrei caine kegwangde, Tinggwang ne pedwa samkak pwa kebamde gikah dima, iciu eh sampet de kemta teidi melu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Tet. 12:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Kedanemene hezaibe de kemzai gade mapwa de ngaulu lacai, cide au sampet kebeu gade meda. Dede Tinggwang Abraham de cide sampet gade peu. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Ciciu cai, hezaibe dai ziemne no? Cide hezai gikah kecu ziemne sampet kebeube gwang kemaktane peu la zielie kaisi beu. Hezaibe au tinggimgwame ne hekak tetkebambe dage balie gaibeu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Cu hekak ketetbe au mi hangge rünne ziemne ma, dede Tinggwang au ket lie. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Cine hezaibe Tinggwang sampet dungde renia lani? Ciciu mezing! Kedanemene kering peulu kebui hezaibe kaibeu liecai, iciu cai hezaibe kemzai gade mide tei masangkelu ngau lubui. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Dede Kesanglaisiu rang kecu ma pelane kemau baang teidi delie zeu, iciu eh nlumkelu leune de Jisu Khrista de nlumkelu dene anuide kelilu zielie sampet kebeude peulu kerane.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Cu kenlum anuida kegwang dwa, hezaibe kang gage anuide hebaangme tei eh baangdi, kenlum de liagai kemaktane. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Cine Khrista gwang kemaktane hezaibe ne anuide gum pungla, ciciu eh kenlum gade anuide tei masanglu kerane. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Dede cu kenlum gwang kelu gade anui hezaibe kangga bamsi meda.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang namedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kedanemene Khrista Jisu de kenlum gade nnui pelane Tinggwang namedung di delu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Kedanemene nnui Khrista gage duipum teigai kelu leune Khrista de teu bah luda. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Cika Jewme mede Greekme de tsam swa ma, hebaang keteime mede tei kemakme de tsam swa ma, mipei mede mipui tsam swa ma kedanemene nnui pelane Khrista Jisu gade ketdi delu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Cu nnui Khrista gu liecai, ciucai nnui au Abraham leuhme da, nah sampet rehi gade mapwamedung da.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ih rang gaila, mapwabe de hena bam kecu tane, pa au hebaangme swade tsam ma, pa hangdeu kedi ge mpaube ge liede. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Dede pe pei pe tingba riet kenzeu cang kemaktane pa hema keteume kangga lung nah mide peu pema pie bamla. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Cinzwa eh, anui hena kebamdau, anui kideube kengkieng keteume kangga la. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Dede petingbe cangsiak gwang luge, Tinggwang pe Na de langgai eh peu mipui ge dade nah hezaibe kang gade mna lu, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />iciu eh hezaibe kangga kebammedung de rilu kerane, nah anui pe name teilu kerane. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Nah nnui pe name kecu ziemne, Tinggwang pe Na Rabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang pe Na Rabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rampaube Jisu Rabe ne penuide pe name ge nzwa eh Tinggwang da peu gwang lula. </char></note> langpwa anui mlung gage kaigai, Rabe cide ne, “Abba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Apei</char></note> Apei,” de qula. <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Cine nnui au hebaangme meda, dede pena dida, nah pena dicai, Tinggwang mapwame ge dida.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Gentileme ziu kepeei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Nnui Tinggwang de cilu kemakdau, ring kemak rabedung kangga kilabaangme teigwang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:19">Isa. 37:19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:11">Jer. 2:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Dede cu nnui Tinggwang de ci kelucai, mede Tinggwang nnuide ci kelucai, nnui dainzwa kemnei nah pemi kegah rabedung da cailigwang dai eh nnui cidungde baang teidai neu lano? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Nnui tingbazie nah hekei zie nah peting pehi nah mmidung mnei la! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ih nnui dage a ta tei kegaide kemta teidi kera Ih hing bamlie.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Sinamedung, Ih de nnui nzwa kelu nzwa nnuide Ih nzwa lulo Ih nnui dage kie gaila. Nnui a dage ma kemau gede teigai ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ih nda nnui dage samlia keyibe rang ledeu kecu Ih yi mcang kemak ziemne kecu nnui cibam. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />A pumteih kemnei ne nnuide kedakpie liede, nnui acu nneu dima mede gidi ma, dede nnui acu Tinggwang samgwame ge nzwa eh ngngwalu, Khrista Jisu de nzwa acu ngngwalu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Iciucai nnui suikeyi de daiga bamno? Kedanemene, nnui teilu buicai, nnui miak de letlwe cidungde acu peu dilu kebui Ih nnui zierang tei lubui. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Iciu cai, Ih nnui dage kesangbe rang eh nnui ngauraume teidi deni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:10">Amo. 5:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Penui nnuide luulu neula, dede keyibe ziemne ma, dede penui nnuide anui dade teuntsamdi neula, iciu eh nnui penui ziemne helung kailu kerane. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Dede kehei dau liede makeyibe ziemne helung kai kebamde au yi, Ih nnuide ngngwa bam kemakdau liede. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />A namedung, nnui Khrista nzwa lunghlu kemaktane Ih au hena tetteei teeidai bam dida, <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />dede Ih cu nnuide ngngwa bam kera regui lei, iciu eh a samrang tsamlu kerane, kedanemene Ih nnui ziemne a lung keherei bamlie.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hagar penai Sarah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />A dage ranglo, nnui hezaibe kangga la keneume, nnui hezaibe kingneila meni? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Kedanemene Abraham pena hangna bam lie kesanglaisiu ga raupwa la, hangge kilabaang pui dade nah kedabe kila tei kemakbe pui dade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:5">Ken. 16:5</ref>;<ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Kilapui dade lungh kelube au pumteihbe zai gade, dede kila tei kemakbe pui dade lungh kelube au sampet gade. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Aide sam rang keda kegai ge nzwa ranggai, kedanemene mipui ai kenade samting samkakkelu kena. Hangge cai Sinai Deutu gade hebaang gage mna gai kelube; aide cai Hagar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Cu Hagar au Arabia ga Sinai Deutu deda; nah pa cu kebam Jerusalem de rehi da, kedanemene pa pe name de ngngwa hebaang tei kebamne. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Dede Jerusalem nreube de au hebaang teima, nah pa au anui pui da. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kedanemene kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa raupwa la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Nang nagahpui, n suiyi lu, hena mna gaikelakbe pui;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">n suiyi eh sah gailu, nang hena tetteei teei kemakbe pui;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">kedanemene gi kedibepui name au</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">pe nahpei kebamme swade pena kieeki lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 54:1">Lei. 54:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Dede, sinamedung, nnui au Isaac nzwa, sampet kebeu namedung da. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Dede cipau tingdau pumteih zai gade lungh kelube ne Rabe zai gade lungh kelube de teikeherei kecu nzwa, cude cide nzwa da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Ken. 21:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Dede kesanglaisiu daipai rang gaino? “Kilabaang pui nah pe napei de langgi dilu. Kedanemene kilabaang pui na baang kemak pui na de ngngwa mabam nzi daulak lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Ken. 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ciziemne, sinamedung, anui au kilabaang pui namedung ma, dede baang kemak pui name lie.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Khrista ga suirangketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Suirang teilu kerane Khrista anuide lungmpet beuda. Ciziemne sap ntip lulo, nah hebaang ngwanggai dwak daiso.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ainie, Ih, Paul, nnui dage rangla, nnui hegeu rum lacai, nnui ziemne Khrista pe kemmi gah. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Ih keheibe de dage hegeurum kelabe au hezai pelane mzai maisialie kecu zierang teigai daila. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Nnui hezaibe gade nnuide tei masanglu kelame de Khrista dade keumpet dida; nnui au ngaugia gwale la dida. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Kedanemene kenlum gade, Tinggwang Rabe gade, anuide tei masanglu kera kereguide kwa sünne bam. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Kedanemene Khrista Jisu gade hegeukerum de nah rumkemak de magede ma, dede keku gade kenlum peta ketei rünne. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Nnui au pak petau tei lada. Cau nnuide kesangbe samzai ketei gade kaam lano? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kecung kegai aide au Tinggwang nnuide qu kelube dade gwang ma! <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Tsehi kecam nage le tokkui henet kelu pelane tei nggau lula. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Ih au Rampaube gade nnui ma kedabe mning dilak ha nlumla. Dede nnuide kebwak kela keheibe de pe ziehi ngauzie. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Dede sinamedung, Ih cude hegeukerum ha rangla liecai, daitei acu cude tei keherei lareu no? Ciciu liecai cross lampui kaam kebamde keugi dida. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Nnuide kebwak kelame de Ih au peu penuikatei penuide dangdi neulie!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Sinamedung, nnuide au suirang tei kera qu luda. Dede nnui suirang ketei de ziemne nnui pumteih lungning tei kera teiso; meliene, keku gade hangge gede nghalu. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Kedanemene aja ket gade hezaibe pelane teicang luda, cide, “Nang nkatei ncu keku nzwa n kidabe de kulu maisia.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev. 19:18</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 22:39-40">Mat. 22:39-40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Dede nnui hangge gede ngki nah tuityei bam liecai, nnui hangge ne kedage de ngkapdi melu kerane mriak lulo.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rabe gade kelungh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Ih ranggaila, Kemci Rabe gade tetlu, iciude nnui pumtei hengin de tei dilak. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Kedanemene pumteih hengindung au Kemci Rabe de renia la, nah Rabe au pumteih de renia la. Kedanemene ai kenade ket ketde kengaurau lala, iciu eh nnui teikeneubedung nnui tei melu kerane. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Dede Kemci Rabe ne nnuide ngngwa la liecai, nnui au hezaibe kangga la meda. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Cu pumtieh batadung au hecili bam, cidungde cai: kemmha, mcikemak, kenlien, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />mamie kereca, kereka, mide ngaukerau, keregi, miriak kesia, rata kesia, miziu keci, pang kepop, hemaa ketsamtsam ketei, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ma kehengin, zausak kemie, zau sakmie eh kenlwang, nah cikenzwa bedung. Ih ndaa nnui dage mrai rang kegai nzwa Ih nnuide mrai ranggai la, aidungde tei kelame Tinggwang hegwangram gum gailak. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Dede Rabe tsi au keku, suiyi, lungciep, helungketie, mizai keyi, keyi, masang, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />kenciep, nah mikatei mide ketip kecu; aidungde de mmau kela hezai gede gah. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Nah Khrista Jisu gu tei kedime au pumteih lungning nah hengindung de si eh gwak dida.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Anui Rabe gade lunghla liecai, anui Rabe gade de tetla lugo. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Anui ngangdi melu go, mede ketket rata tei nah ketket de miriakdi melu go.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Pelane dage makeyi teikegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Sinamedung, mige kemau keheibe teila eh tui lucai, nnui rabe kilam ntip kelame nnui nciep eh pecu tei mmi dailu maisia. Nnuide mriak bamlu, iciu eh mdakkepie gade nnui kaudi melu kerane. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Hangge ge püt cuilu, iciude nnui Khrista zaibe teicang luzie. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Kedanemene keheibe de pa magede ma delwe pekatei pecu le mage lie cetla cai, pa pekatei pecu cwa dida. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Dede peu hangge gede pekatei pe bata de pie mcetlu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pekatei pe bata de pie mcetlu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">peu pecu le pwa Tinggwang sam de kedalu, cide ne kekambe nai anuide tiak zie.</char></note> maisia, nah ciude pa hegielu kera kiebe pekatei pe ziemne kecu nah mi kedame ziemne kemak ngau luzie. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Kedanemene hangge ge kecu pekatei pe püt pung zie.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Dede Tinggwang sam ledeukelube de au ma keyi peciakne teu eh pe keledeube dage nzi kerabe. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Nnuide cwa diso. Tinggwang de henui tei daulak, mige pa mrok kegaide rum daizie. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Kedanemene pekatei pe pumteih gage mrok kegaibe, pe pumteih gade kengkap rum zie. Dede Rabe gage mrok kegaibe, Rabe gade kelungta kering rum luzie. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Nah anui makeyi ketei ga leudi kerabe ma, kedanemene anui pütdi mene bam lucai peting siakdau rum zielu. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Cine, anui peting keyi ngau keludau, anui mina pelane dage ma keyi teigai maisia, nah bam keraide kenlum kilungme dage.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hegeukerum ma dede dam keheci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Ih nnui dage laisiukau kedidung teu eh a ba le rau kegaide pie gailo. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Nnui kemei tei eh hegeurum kera ketang kelame au hegwazube mide teilia neula. Khrista Jisu cross ziemne penuide tei keherei melu kerane penui aide teila. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kedanemene hegeurum kelame de hezaibe mzui lama, dede penui nnuide peu hegeurum neula, iciu eh penui nnui pumteihbe ziemne hegielu kerane. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Dede Ih au anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista cross de ziemne gwale hegielu kera gah, cide ziemne a dwade kideube de gwak dida, nah Ih kideube de ngngwa tsai dida. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kedanemene hegeu kerumde nah hegeu rum kemakde au magede ma, dede mikatei mide tei heci kelu deda. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Aipau zai rehi ga lungh kela leune nah Tinggwang mina Israel reu peu lungciep nah ngaugia bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Cu gade migede de peu acu tei keherei ta dilu, kedanemene Ih a pumteih ga Jisu zamdung de pungla di delu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Sinamedung, peu nnui rabe de anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugiabe de ngngwala kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>